/**
 * EMV CDA (Combined DDA/AC) Support Detector
 *
 * Detects if a card supports CDA by extracting and analyzing the AIP (Application Interchange Profile, Tag 82).
 *
 * CDA Detection Logic:
 * - Extract AIP (Tag 82) from GPO response (preferred) or records (fallback)
 * - Check bit 0 (LSB) of AIP byte 1 to determine CDA support
 * - Check bit 7 (MSB) of AIP byte 2 to determine enhanced CDA support
 *
 * AIP Format per EMV Book 3 (2 bytes):
 *   Byte 1: Application Capabilities - Part 1
 *     - Bit 0 (LSB): CDA (Combined DDA/AC) supported
 *   Byte 2: Application Capabilities - Part 2
 *     - Bit 7 (MSB): Combined DDA/AC generation supported (enhanced CDA mode)
 */
